  "correct_answer": "1.5",
  "solution": {
    "text": "System of equations can be written as<br /><math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br />Using Cramer&#39;s rule,&nbsp;for non-trivial solution <math><mo>&#8710;</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>c</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>c</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>c</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>c</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>c</mi><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>a</mi></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>b</mi></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>c</mi></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>"
